msgstr "适配器"

msgid "Add target"
msgstr "添加目标"

msgid "After sysupgrade, reinstall the single matching package or run /etc/rule-bot-client/recover.sh. The script detects apk/opkg and architecture; it never runs automatically."
msgstr "sysupgrade 后请重装匹配的单包，或运行 /etc/rule-bot-client/recover.sh；脚本会识别 apk/opkg 与架构，且绝不会自动执行。"

msgid "An offline controller may be saved; Rule-Bot Client will reconnect independently."
msgstr "离线控制器也可保存；Rule-Bot 客户端会独立重连。"

msgid "An explicit secret overrides automatic discovery. Clear it to use automatic discovery again."
msgstr "显式密钥优先于自动发现的密钥。清除覆盖后，系统恢复自动发现。"

msgid "Automatic adapters"
msgstr "自动适配器"

msgid "Backup and restore"
msgstr "备份与恢复"

msgid "Backups include UCI, credentials, certificates, exclusion list, persistent data, Rule-Bot state, and recovery script. Runtime-generated config, automatically discovered adapter secrets, and status are excluded."
msgstr "备份包含 UCI、凭据、证书、排除清单、持久数据、Rule-Bot 状态和恢复脚本；不包含运行时配置、自动发现密钥与状态。"

msgid "Backups contain credentials. Store downloaded archives securely."
msgstr "备份包含凭据。请安全保管下载的归档文件。"

